    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Алло́, Ма́ша? Я звони́л, но бы́ло за́нято.","gloss":"Hello, Masha? I called, but it was busy."},{"by":"b","text":"Да, я была́ занята́. Ма́ма больна́.","gloss":"Yes, I was busy. Mum is ill."},{"by":"a","text":"Ты должна́ ей помога́ть?","gloss":"Do you have to help her?"},{"by":"b","text":"Да. Сего́дня я не свобо́дна. Извини́!","gloss":"Yes. I'm not free today. Sorry!"},{"by":"a","text":"Ничего́! А за́втра ты свобо́дна?","gloss":"That's OK! And are you free tomorrow?"},{"by":"b","text":"За́втра я бу́ду гото́ва в семь.","gloss":"Tomorrow I'll be ready at seven."},{"by":"a","text":"Хорошо́, я рад! А ма́ме на́до к врачу́.","gloss":"Good, I'm glad! And Mum should see a doctor."},{"by":"b","text":"Ты прав. Я позвоню́ врачу́. Пока́!","gloss":"You're right. I'll phone the doctor. Bye!"}] practice true size 1.5 hidden true
    text s1 "за́нят · занята́ · за́нято · за́няты" say "за́нят, занята́, за́нято, за́няты" colors {"а$":"#b5482e","о$":"#8a5fa8","ы$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 540 font_size 50 hidden true
    text s2 "был · была́ · бы́ло · бы́ли" colors {"а$":"#b5482e","о$":"#8a5fa8","и$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 440 font_size 44 hidden true
    text s3 "гото́в · прав · бо́лен · рад" say "гото́в, прав, бо́лен, рад" x 500 y 330 font_size 50 hidden true

A: When Masha isn't free tonight, what does she say instead of свобо́дна? Listen: I ask her.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name q_free

A: Ма́ша, ты свобо́дна сего́дня ве́чером?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t q_free

B: Нет, я занята́. Я должна́ рабо́тать.
    draw balloon_m caption false

    erase balloon_m

    ask "What does she say?" voice b options ["She's free tonight.","She's ill.","She's busy: she has to work."] correct 3 reveal.text "Нет, я занята́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: No, I'm busy. I have to work.
        listen: Нет, я занята́. Я должна́ рабо́тать.
        right: Busy: занята́. And я должна́ рабо́тать, I have to work.
        wrong: Listen for должна́ рабо́тать at the end.

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    erase question_1_stamp

A: Занята́: busy. Masha is a woman, so the а, and here (@highlight z_f color #d4a017 part а$ effect underline@) the stress jumps to the end: занята́.
    draw h_f z_f

A: I say я за́нят: no ending at all, and (@highlight z_m color #d4a017 part ^за effect underline@) the stress at the front.
    draw h_m z_m

A: And за́нято, the busy phone line (@draw h_n z_n@) of lesson 79? The same word, (@draw z_ph@) with о: it's busy, with nobody named.

A: For more than one, (@draw h_p z_p@) and for вы, it's ы: мы за́няты, вы за́няты.

    erase z_ph

A: The first three end (@draw b_m@) like был, (@draw b_f@) была́, бы́ло: (@draw b_n@) nothing, (@draw b_p@) а, о. For more than one it's ы, where бы́ли has и.

A: And there's no word for (@draw ya_z ya_am@) am: я за́нят is the whole sentence. These short words say how someone is.

    erase h_m h_f h_n h_p z_m z_f z_n z_p b_m b_f b_n b_p ya_z ya_am

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Гото́в means ready, and гото́ва keeps (@draw w_got_q@) its stress. So I ask Masha: ты гото́ва?

B: Ещё не гото́ва!
    draw w_got_no

A: A thing can be ready (@draw w_soup w_uzhin@) too: у́жин гото́в, dinner's ready.

    erase w_got_q w_got_no w_soup w_uzhin

A: Прав (@draw w_pravda@) is related to пра́вда, the truth: ты прав, (@draw w_prav_m@) you're right, to me, and to Masha (@draw w_prav_f@) ты права́, stress on the а.

    erase w_pravda w_prav_m w_prav_f

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    quiz "Бо́лен means ill: a man says я бо́лен. Now guess: what does a woman say? Я …" store chk reveal.text больна́ reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 460 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a
        right: Больна́: the а comes, and the е drops out.
        wrong: Think of свобо́ден and свобо́дна: the е drops out.
        * бо́лена
        + больна́
        * бо́лен

    erase question_2_stamp

A: Like (@draw sick w_bolen w_bolna@) свобо́ден (@draw w_svob@) and свобо́дна, the е drops out when (@highlight w_bolen color #d4a017 part ен$ effect underline@) the а comes: бо́лен, больна́.

    erase w_bolen w_bolna w_svob

A: Бо́лен is being ill, maybe for (@draw w_mama@) days: ма́ма больна́.

    erase sick w_mama

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: And рад, glad, from lesson 84, is one of these (@draw w_rad@) short words too: я рад, я ра́да.

    erase w_rad

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: For was and will be, (@draw w_bb@) add был or бу́ду, as Masha does.

B: Я (@draw w_was@) была́ занята́. За́втра (@draw w_will clock7@) я бу́ду гото́ва в семь.

    erase w_bb w_was w_will clock7

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Now Masha and I, on the phone. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    quiz "A man has too much work tonight. Which word finishes his sentence: Я …?" reveal.text "Я за́нят." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: За́нят: a man, so no ending.
        wrong: A man: no ending at all, like был.
        * занята́
        + за́нят
        * за́нято

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "A woman makes a good point. Tell her she's right." reveal.text "Ты права́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ты права́: the а, for a woman.
        wrong: To a woman: the а, like была́.
        + Ты права́.
        * Ты прав.
        * Ты пра́вда.

    erase question_4_stamp

    quiz "Time to go. Ask your friends if they're ready. Вы…?" reveal.text "Вы гото́вы?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Вы гото́вы: вы takes the ы.
        wrong: More than one, and вы: the ы, as in за́няты.
        * гото́в
        * гото́ва
        + гото́вы

    erase question_5_stamp

    ask "Your friend asks why you can't come. Say that your mum is ill." say_it "Ма́ма больна́." gloss "Mum is ill." voice b show cue reveal.text "Ма́ма больна́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase question_6_stamp

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. As a man, type: Yesterday I was busy." answer ["вчера я был занят","я был занят вчера","я вчера был занят","вчера был занят","был занят вчера","вчера я была занята","я была занята вчера","я вчера была занята","вчера была занята"] reveal.text "Вчера́ я был за́нят." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Вчера́ я был за́нят: был, then за́нят, both with no ending.
        wrong: Вчера́, я, был for was, then за́нят.

    erase question_7_stamp

    group board members ["s1","s2","s3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So за́нят, гото́в, прав and бо́лен change like был, была́: nothing for him, а for her; ы for more than one. And no word for am.
    highlight s1 s2 color #d4a017 effect underline

    erase board

B: Я гото́ва! Пойдём!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "Я гото́ва! Пойдём!" say "Я гото́ва! Пойдём!" say_voice b colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 500 y 290 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: holidays, and what to wish people. С Но́вым го́дом!
